Amulet, imho. Or find (reverse genocide) some silver dragon and switch to
SDSM + cloak of MR (or Castle whishes) (allow AoLS, more a confort than a
real necessity, you can perfectly ascend without dying).

> 4. Any other suggestions/comments/tips as I have not yet progressed this
> far in the game?

Genocide mind flayers and MMF (beware, no blessed geno since you're a
dwarf !)
Blessed geno L before going to hell.
You may want to blessed geno V, but that's not really necessary.
Get shock resistance before you start throwing Mojo everywhere.
Get more HPs (alchemy or nurse dancing, you choose (or both)). 300 HPs
should be more confortable and not too hard to achieve.
Make a lot of holy water, bless all that you use frequently.
Keep a separate bag (not holding) with blessed scroll of remove curse and
2 holy water (in case BoH become cursed).
Dig out stair-tostair path in each diggable level, fill path in Medusa.
You''l hopefully need to go up as fast as possible. The sofisticated
option is to dig pits on both sides of your path, in order to have
monsters surrounding you trapped.
In the same order of idea, I often dig out every square surrounding stairs
in order to allow easy pet transport with magic whistle (if there are 8
square surrounding you, you can easily walk with 4 or 5 pets).
Get speed boots.
Enchant your gear to +4/+5.
Switch your orcish helm to helm of telepathy or eleven leather helm
(better AC).

